{
  "id": "121",
  "title": "Help Taking a Photo",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-04-23",
  "synopsis": "Sometimes when you're traveling in China you might want to ask someone to take a picture for you. In this lesson we learn how to do that.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/114/3850af435de4444d11f4f808f9cdb8d108097a12.mp3?1698320917",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "帮拍照\n\n小李：你好，请问你能帮我们拍张照吗？\n保罗：好的，没问题。\n小李：最好能把后面的天安门也照进去。\n保罗：好的。\n小李：谢谢。你只用摁这个按钮就好。\n保罗：好的。准备好了吗？1、2、3…\n小李：茄子！\n保罗：再来一张。1、2、3……\n小李：茄子！\n保罗：好了！\n小李：好的。照得太好了。谢谢。\n保罗：不客气！",
    "traditional": "幫拍照\n\n小李：你好，請問你能幫我們拍張照嗎？\n保羅：好的，沒問題。\n小李：最好能把後面的天安門也照進去。\n保羅：好的。\n小李：謝謝。你只用摁這個按鈕就好。\n保羅：好的。準備好了嗎？1、2、3…\n小李：茄子！\n保羅：再來一張。1、2、3……\n小李：茄子！\n保羅：好了！\n小李：好的。照得太好了。謝謝。\n保羅：不客氣！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Help Taking a Photo"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小李：你好，请问你能帮我们拍张照吗？",
      "traditional": "小李：你好，請問你能幫我們拍張照嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lǐ nǐ hǎo qǐng wèn nǐ néng bāng wǒ men pāi zhāng zhào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Hello, could you help us take a picture?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的，没问题。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的，沒問題。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de méi wèn tí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Sure, no problem."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小李：最好能把后面的天安门也照进去。",
      "traditional": "小李：最好能把後面的天安門也照進去。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lǐ zuì hǎo néng bǎ hòu miàn de tiān ān mén yě zhào jìn qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: It would be great if you could also fit Tiananmen behind us in the picture."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Sure."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小李：谢谢。你只用摁这个按钮就好。",
      "traditional": "小李：謝謝。你只用摁這個按鈕就好。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lǐ xiè xie nǐ zhǐ yòng èn zhè ge àn niǔ jiù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Thank you. You only have to push this button here."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。准备好了吗？1、2、3…",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。準備好了嗎？1、2、3…",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de zhǔn bèi hǎo le ma 1 1 1",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok, are you ready? 1, 2, 3 ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小李：茄子！",
      "traditional": "小李：茄子！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lǐ qié zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Cheese!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：再来一张。1、2、3……",
      "traditional": "保羅：再來一張。1、2、3……",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zài lái yì zhāng 1 1 1",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: One more. 1, 2, 3 ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小李：茄子！",
      "traditional": "小李：茄子！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lǐ qié zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Cheese!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "保罗：好了！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好了！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: All right!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小李：好的。照得太好了。谢谢。",
      "traditional": "小李：好的。照得太好了。謝謝。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lǐ hǎo de zhào de tài hǎo le xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Ok. These are great photos. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "保罗：不客气！",
      "traditional": "保羅：不客氣！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    }
